OL,4,CDemocrats win largest House majority   
OL,5,Csince 1992 after flipping North        
OL,6,CCarolina seat                          
OL,7,GThe Democratic Party has won the       
OL,8,Glargest majority in the US House of    
OL,9,GRepresentatives since 1992, after      
OL,10,GDemocrat Chuck Hubbard unseated        
OL,11,GRepublican Representative Virginia     
OL,12,GFoxx in North Carolina.                
OL,14,FThe race was called on Sunday, with    
OL,15,FHubbard beating Foxx by 330 votes with 
OL,16,F99% counted. It was one of the closest 
OL,17,Fcontests of the recent midterm         
OL,18,Felections, in which Democrats also     
OL,19,Fsecured the Senate.                    
